{%- comment -%}
  Casify: collection page, "The aisle".

  A candy-shop aisle sign (KIE plate) can hang over the collection's own title
  and description (setting show_sign, off since 2026-11-09: the title is then a
  visually hidden h1). Beside it, or alone in one row, three promise stickers with little animated
  characters (snippets/cv-promise-stickers.liquid, GSAP + Motion); with the
  stickers off, the pack meter can take their place. Below: Shopify's own storefront
  filters in a drawer with live counts and removable chips, real sort, the
  product grid and pagination. Filters, sort and pages update in place
  through the Section Rendering API, with ordinary links and a submit button
  as the no-script path.

  The grid uses the home page's showcase cards (snippets/cv-showcase-card.liquid,
  styles in assets/cv-showcase.css): photo, short title, one line, features,
  phone and color counts, real saving. Their enamel button opens a quick pick
  (colour and phone) that adds the exact variant, so nothing is added with a
  guessed phone model; a product with one variant adds straight to the bag.

  Filters appear once they are set up in Shopify admin (Search & Discovery >
  Filters); a "phone model" filter is the one shoppers here need most.

  Behaviour + motion: assets/cv-pages.js. Styles: assets/cv-pages.css.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'cv-badges.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'cv-pages.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'cv-showcase.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign has_filters = false
  assign active_count = 0
  for f in collection.filters
    if f.type == 'price_range'
      assign has_filters = true
      if f.min_value.value != nil or f.max_value.value != nil
        assign active_count = active_count | plus: 1
      endif
    elsif f.values.size > 0
      assign has_filters = true
      assign active_count = active_count | plus: f.active_values.size
    endif
  endfor
  assign sort_current = collection.sort_by | default: collection.default_sort_by
  assign clear_url = collection.url
  if collection.sort_by != blank
    assign clear_url = collection.url | append: '?sort_by=' | append: collection.sort_by
  endif
  assign noun_one = section.settings.noun_one | default: 'product'
  assign noun_many = section.settings.noun_many | default: 'products'
  assign count_noun = noun_many
  if collection.products_count == 1
    assign count_noun = noun_one
  endif
  comment
    Pack percentages come from Theme settings (cv_pack_2_pct / cv_pack_3_pct), the one place that
    must match the automatic discounts. The section's own pack_2_pct / pack_3_pct stay in the
    schema (templates store them) but are no longer read. 0 in both hides the meter.
  endcomment
  assign pack2 = settings.cv_pack_2_pct | default: 0
  assign pack3 = settings.cv_pack_3_pct | default: 0
  assign show_packs = false
  if section.settings.show_packs
    if pack2 > 0 or pack3 > 0
      assign show_packs = true
    endif
  endif
  comment
    The promise stickers take the column beside the sign; the pack meter shows there only with them off.
  endcomment
  assign show_promises = false
  if section.settings.show_promises
    if section.settings.promise_1 != blank or section.settings.promise_2 != blank or section.settings.promise_3 != blank
      assign show_promises = true
    endif
  endif
  assign show_aside = false
  if show_promises or show_packs
    assign show_aside = true
  endif
  comment
    The hanging sign is off unless the setting turns it on. Without it the collection title stays
    the page's h1 for search engines and screen readers, visually hidden (the breadcrumb shows it),
    and the promise stickers run in one row on wide screens.
  endcomment
  assign show_sign = section.settings.show_sign
  comment
    The phone model filter goes first and opens first: shoppers here pick a phone before anything else.
  endcomment
  assign model_re = 'model,phone,device,compatib,applicable' | split: ','
-%}

{%- paginate collection.products by section.settings.per_page -%}
<div class="cv-page-root cvl" data-cvl data-section-id="{{ section.id }}" data-url="{{ collection.url }}">
  <nav class="cv-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_home' | t }}</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}">{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_collections' | t }}</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    <span class="is-current" aria-current="page">{{ collection.title | escape }}</span>
  </nav>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- The aisle sign + promise stickers (or the pack meter) ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <header class="cvl__hd{% unless show_sign %} cvl__hd--nosign{% endunless %}{% unless show_aside %} cvl__hd--solo{% endunless %}">
    {%- if show_sign -%}
    <div class="cvl__sign-wrap">
      <div class="cvl__sign" data-cv-sign>
        <img class="cvl__sign-plate" src="{{ 'pages-aisle-sign.webp' | asset_url }}" width="900" height="655" alt="" fetchpriority="high">
        <h1 class="cvl__title"><span>{{ collection.title | escape }}</span></h1>
      </div>
      {%- if collection.description != blank -%}
        <div class="cvl__desc rte">{{ collection.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <h1 class="cvl__vh">{{ collection.title | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if collection.description != blank -%}
        <div class="cvl__desc rte">{{ collection.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if show_promises -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign sticker_row = true
        if show_sign
          assign sticker_row = false
        endif
      -%}
      {%- render 'cv-promise-stickers',
        sid: section.id,
        heading: section.settings.promise_heading,
        p1: section.settings.promise_1,
        p2: section.settings.promise_2,
        p3: section.settings.promise_3,
        row: sticker_row
      -%}
    {%- elsif show_packs -%}
      {%- render 'cv-pack-meter', sid: section.id, pack2: pack2, pack3: pack3, heading: section.settings.pack_heading -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </header>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- Toolbar, filter drawer, chips: one form ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  <form class="cvl__form" id="cvlForm-{{ section.id }}" action="{{ collection.url }}" method="get" data-cvl-form>
    <div class="cvl__bar">
      {%- if has_filters -%}
        <button type="button" class="cvl__filter-btn" data-cvl-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="cvlDrawer-{{ section.id }}">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h4M12 17h8"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2.2"/><circle cx="10" cy="17" r="2.2"/></svg>
          <span>{{ 'collections.filters.filter' | t }}</span>
          <span class="cvl__badge" data-cvl-swap="badge"{% if active_count == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ active_count }}</span>
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="cvl__count" data-cvl-swap="count" aria-live="polite">
        <b>{{ collection.products_count }}</b> {{ count_noun | escape }}
      </p>

      {%- if section.settings.show_sort -%}
        <label class="cvl__sort">
          <span>{{ 'collections.filters.sort' | t }}</span>
          <span class="cvl__select">
            <select name="sort_by" data-cvl-sort>
              {%- for option in collection.sort_options -%}
                <option value="{{ option.value }}"{% if option.value == sort_current %} selected{% endif %}>{{ option.name }}</option>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </select>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </span>
        </label>
        <noscript><button type="submit" class="cvl__apply-inline">{{ 'collections.filters.apply' | t }}</button></noscript>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if has_filters -%}
      <dialog class="cvl__drawer" id="cvlDrawer-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="cvlDrawerTitle-{{ section.id }}" data-cvl-drawer>
        <div class="cvl__drawer-hd">
          <h2 class="cvl__drawer-title" id="cvlDrawerTitle-{{ section.id }}">{{ 'collections.filters.filter' | t }}</h2>
          <button type="button" class="cvl__close" data-cvl-close aria-label="Close filters">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="cvl__groups" data-cvl-swap="groups">
          {%- assign opened_one = false -%}
          {%- for pass in (1..2) -%}
          {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign f_label = filter.label | downcase
              assign is_model = false
              for k in model_re
                if f_label contains k
                  assign is_model = true
                endif
              endfor
              assign show_group = false
              if filter.type == 'price_range' or filter.values.size > 0
                if pass == 1 and is_model
                  assign show_group = true
                elsif pass == 2 and is_model == false
                  assign show_group = true
                endif
              endif
            -%}
            {%- if show_group -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign group_active = filter.active_values.size
                if filter.type == 'price_range'
                  assign group_active = 0
                  if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil
                    assign group_active = 1
                  endif
                endif
                assign open_group = false
                if group_active > 0 or opened_one == false
                  assign open_group = true
                endif
                assign opened_one = true
              -%}
              <details class="cvl__group{% if is_model %} cvl__group--model{% endif %}" data-cvl-group="{{ filter.param_name | escape }}"{% if open_group %} open{% endif %}>
                <summary class="cvl__group-q">
                  <span>{{ filter.label | escape }}</span>
                  {%- if group_active > 0 -%}<span class="cvl__group-n">{{ group_active }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
                </summary>
                <div class="cvl__group-a">
                  {%- case filter.type -%}
                    {%- when 'price_range' -%}
                      <div class="cvl__price">
                        <label>
                          <span>{{ 'collections.filters.from' | t }}</span>
                          <span class="cvl__money"><i>{{ cart.currency.symbol }}</i><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" name="{{ filter.min_value.param_name }}" min="0" max="{{ filter.range_max | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' }}" placeholder="0"{% if filter.min_value.value %} value="{{ filter.min_value.value | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' }}"{% endif %}></span>
                        </label>
                        <label>
                          <span>To</span>
                          <span class="cvl__money"><i>{{ cart.currency.symbol }}</i><input type="number" inputmode="decimal" name="{{ filter.max_value.param_name }}" min="0" max="{{ filter.range_max | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' }}" placeholder="{{ filter.range_max | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' }}"{% if filter.max_value.value %} value="{{ filter.max_value.value | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' }}"{% endif %}></span>
                        </label>
                      </div>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <ul class="cvl__checks" role="list">
                        {%- for value in filter.values -%}
                          {%- assign dead = false -%}
                          {%- if value.count == 0 and value.active == false -%}{%- assign dead = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                          <li>
                            <label class="cvl__check{% if dead %} is-dead{% endif %}">
                              <input type="checkbox" name="{{ value.param_name }}" value="{{ value.value | escape }}"{% if value.active %} checked{% endif %}{% if dead %} disabled{% endif %}>
                              <span class="cvl__tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span>
                              <span class="cvl__check-label">{{ value.label | escape }}</span>
                              <span class="cvl__check-n">{{ value.count }}</span>
                            </label>
                          </li>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </ul>
                  {%- endcase -%}
                </div>
              </details>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="cvl__drawer-ft">
          <a class="cvl__clear" href="{{ clear_url }}" data-cvl-link>{{ 'collections.filters.clear_all' | t }}</a>
          <button type="submit" class="cvl__apply" data-cvl-swap="apply" data-cvl-apply>{{ 'collections.filters.show_count' | t: count: collection.products_count, noun: count_noun }}</button>
        </div>
      </dialog>
    {%- endif -%}
  </form>

  <div data-cvl-swap="chips">
    {%- if active_count > 0 -%}
      <ul class="cvl__chips" role="list" aria-label="Filters in use">
        {%- for filter in collection.filters -%}
          {%- if filter.type == 'price_range' -%}
            {%- if filter.min_value.value != nil or filter.max_value.value != nil -%}
              <li>
                <a class="cvl__chip" href="{{ filter.url_to_remove }}" data-cvl-link>
                  <span>{{ filter.min_value.value | default: 0 | money }} to {{ filter.max_value.value | default: filter.range_max | money }}</span>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
                  <span class="cvl__vh">{{ 'collections.filters.remove_filter' | t }}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- for value in filter.active_values -%}
              <li>
                <a class="cvl__chip" href="{{ value.url_to_remove }}" data-cvl-link>
                  <span>{{ value.label | escape }}</span>
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
                  <span class="cvl__vh">Remove {{ filter.label | escape }} filter</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        <li><a class="cvl__chip cvl__chip--clear" href="{{ clear_url }}" data-cvl-link>{{ 'collections.filters.clear_all' | t }}</a></li>
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} ---------- The grid ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%} Stars on the cards: Judge.me reviews (verified and imported), read once for every card. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture jm_map -%}{%- render 'cv-jm-verified', mode: 'map' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  <div class="cvl__results" data-cvl-swap="results">
    {%- if collection.products.size > 0 -%}
      {%- liquid
        comment
          reveal: false keeps the grid readable without JS; the card entrance is the section's own motion.
        endcomment
        assign shop_now = 'collections.shop_now' | t
        assign sale_badge = 'collections.sale_badge' | t
        assign new_badge = 'collections.new_badge' | t
      -%}
      <ul class="cvl__grid cvl__grid--showcase" role="list">
        {%- for product in collection.products -%}
          <li class="cvl__cell" data-cvl-cell="{{ product.id }}">
            {%- render 'cv-showcase-card', item: product, index: forloop.index0, sid: section.id, wrapper: 'article', pick: section.settings.quick_pick, reveal: false, cta_label: shop_now, sale_badge: sale_badge, new_badge: new_badge, jm_map: jm_map -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
        <nav class="cv-pager" aria-label="Pagination">
          {%- if paginate.previous -%}
            <a class="cv-pager__step is-prev" href="{{ paginate.previous.url }}" rel="prev" data-cvl-link>
              {%- render 'cv-icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 16 -%}<span>{{ 'general.pagination.previous' | t }}</span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="cv-pager__pages">
            {%- for part in paginate.parts -%}
              {%- if part.is_link -%}
                <a class="cv-pager__n" href="{{ part.url }}" data-cvl-link>{{ part.title }}</a>
              {%- elsif part.title == paginate.current_page -%}
                <span class="cv-pager__n is-current" aria-current="page">{{ part.title }}</span>
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="cv-pager__n is-gap">{{ part.title }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </span>
          {%- if paginate.next -%}
            <a class="cv-pager__step is-next" href="{{ paginate.next.url }}" rel="next" data-cvl-link>
              <span>{{ 'general.pagination.next' | t }}</span>{%- render 'cv-icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 16 -%}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </nav>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elsif active_count > 0 -%}
      <div class="cvl__empty">
        <h2>{{ section.settings.no_match_title | default: 'Nothing matches those filters' | escape }}</h2>
        <p>{{ section.settings.no_match_body | default: 'Take one off and more cases come back.' | escape }}</p>
        <a class="cvl__chip cvl__chip--clear" href="{{ clear_url }}" data-cvl-link>{{ 'collections.filters.clear_all_filters' | t }}</a>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="cvl__empty">
        <h2>{{ section.settings.empty_title | default: 'Nothing on this shelf yet' | escape }}</h2>
        <p>{{ section.settings.empty_body | default: 'Every case in the shop is one tap away.' | escape }}</p>
        <a class="cvl__chip cvl__chip--clear" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ 'collections.empty_cta' | t }}</a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  {%- comment -%} The quick pick dialog itself is rendered once per page by layout/theme.liquid when a card asks for it. {%- endcomment -%}
</div>
{%- comment -%} Card drop and card Add states; listens for section load/unload itself. {%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'cv-collection-motion.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endpaginate -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Collection: the aisle",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "per_page", "label": "Products per page", "min": 8, "max": 48, "step": 4, "default": 24 },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_sort", "label": "Show sort", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "quick_pick", "label": "Quick pick on cards", "default": true, "info": "Cards with more than one variant ask for colour and phone before adding, instead of adding the first variant." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "noun_one", "label": "Count word, one", "default": "product" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "noun_many", "label": "Count word, many", "default": "products" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Sign" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_sign", "label": "Show the hanging sign", "default": false, "info": "Off: the collection title stays on the page for Google and screen readers, out of sight, and the stickers sit in one row on wide screens." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Promise stickers" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_promises", "label": "Show the promise stickers", "default": true, "info": "Three stickers beside the sign, each with a little animated character: a printer, a parcel, a van." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "promise_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Good to know" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "promise_1", "label": "Sticker 1 (printer)", "default": "Printed to order in the USA", "info": "Only promises that are true for every order." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "promise_2", "label": "Sticker 2 (parcel)", "default": "Free replacement if damaged" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "promise_3", "label": "Sticker 3 (van)", "default": "Free shipping" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Pack meter" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_packs", "label": "Show the pack meter", "default": true, "info": "Shows only when the promise stickers are off." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pack_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Mix a pack" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "pack_2_pct", "label": "2 cases: discount", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 1, "unit": "%", "default": 18, "info": "Must match the automatic discount in Shopify admin > Discounts." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "pack_3_pct", "label": "3 cases: discount", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 1, "unit": "%", "default": 31, "info": "Must match the automatic discount in Shopify admin > Discounts." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Empty states" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "no_match_title", "label": "No filter matches: title", "default": "Nothing matches those filters" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "no_match_body", "label": "No filter matches: text", "default": "Take one off and more cases come back." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_title", "label": "Empty collection: title", "default": "Nothing on this shelf yet" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_body", "label": "Empty collection: text", "default": "Every case in the shop is one tap away." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Collection: the aisle" }]
}
{% endschema %}
